(text "J501 is the CM5 OTG port as a USB 2 device. Rd on CC1 and CC2 asks the host for VBUS, which stays\nunconnected: the side link powers the board. Hold SW501 while the CM5 powers up to boot it for rpiboot." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "99244f55-9682-4d85-8292-52b0da7aeac4"))
